            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I don't know how much our statusline code has diverged from upstream Vim at this point. It might be worth upstreaming\r\n\r\nWe pretty much own it now. Vim recently made an [intentionally Neovim-incompatible change](https://github.com/vim/vim/pull/19123#issuecomment-3817597768) so there is little reason to try to align with them.",
